GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "8AC53AF64C661DA7"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{0D20D21BAA9B54C8}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Mission Overview"
     m_sContent "During a MediVac via BFV for a lightly wounded SEAL after a city security operation gone wrong, an IED is detonated causing a SEAL Team to go firm and the BFV MediVac to retreat out of the city. SEALs must survive and extract while under extreme threat, surrounded by the advancing and bloodthirsty Insurgent fighters."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{48AD43496AC46D60}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "	The IED caused damage, one unconscious SEAL, stable. Another wounded severely and actively bleeding. Frogman 6 Romeo will have to evaluate the situation and get the wounded men medical attention immediately."\
     ""\
     "	The Bushmaster BFVs are coming in to the BUSHMASTER PICKUP point marked on your maps to CasEvac the wounded SEALs. The Bushmaster elements may have to make 2 trips or more (depending on how many can fit and/or how many are available to be picked up at the pickup point at the time of the BFVs first arrival)."\
     ""\
     "	How the CO coordinates their teams for extraction after/during getting the wounded SEALS out is completely up to them, and will be the deciding factor in the fate of 3 SEAL Teams. "\
     ""\
     "	The only team that must stay within their original compound is FROGMAN 6 ROMEO (As the BUSHMASTER PICKUP point is outside their compound) unless the BUSHMASTER elements have been destroyed. The other SEAL Teams can move to the COs discretion."\
     ""\
     "	Good Luck."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0D4CA2713E99ACE3}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "	There was an explosion from an IED in the southern portion of the city. Some of the civilians said they saw the Americans go into a building in a compound somewhere in the SEARCH AREA."\
     ""\
     "	They also saw an American BFV drive away, out of the city going North. This is your chance! Get everyone from your neighborhoods and get ready to kill every last one of them."\
     " "\
     "	There is some stashed away RPG tubes and rockets in the Mosque for events like this, they could come in handy if the CO feels like they need them. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{63EBA030DC78BB50}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "	There are 3 SEAL Teams Available. Spread across the South and West areas of the city. As well as 2 BFVs and crews."\
     ""\
     "          -Frogman 6 Romeo, 6 strong, Command SEAL Team, 2 wounded and unconscious (1 actively bleeding). South-East in city."\
     ""\
     "          -Frogman 5 Romeo, 8 strong, Standard SEAL Team. Southern city."\
     ""\
     "          -Frogman 4 Romeo, 8 strong, Standard SEAL Team. South-Western city."\
     ""\
     "          -Bushmaster 1, 3 strong, BFV Crew. Far Northern MSR."\
     ""\
     "          -Bushmaster 2, 3 strong, BFV Crew. Far Northern MSR."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A1EFD8C749DA6444}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "	We have forces spread all across the town, and that IED woke them all up (AI). Our organized forces (Players) are now massing around the Northern neighborhoods of the city."\
     ""\
     "          -Sheikh Cell, 4 strong, command element. Centrally located."\
     ""\
     "          -Khaled Cell, 8 strong, MG and AR element, closest to SEARCH AREA."\
     ""\
     "	  -Ali Cell, 6 strong, RPG element, very limited on rockets, Northern-most cell."\
     ""\
     "	  -There is a cache with 2 RPG tubes and extra rockets with some RPG backpacks in the Mosque."\
     ""\
     "	  -There are alleyways between compounds and ramps between rooftops observed in the areas around the Mosque and South-East of the city. There are also ROADBLOCKS that cut off the entire road, keep these in mind and reference the markers on your maps."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{ACC1032706E44947}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "III. Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "	There is a significant enemy presence in the city, primarily around the mosque/market area and surrounding FROGMAN 6 ROMEOs position, but we have intel that enemy are massing on the North side of the city and preparing a coordinated assault on FROGMAN 6 ROMEOs compound."\
     ""\
     "          -Visual confirmation on a PKM being brought to the North of FROGMAN 6 ROMEOs position."\
     ""\
     "          -It is believed that enemy fighters may have limited anti-armor capabilities in the form of RPG rockets."\
     ""\
     "          -There are alleyways between compounds and ramps between rooftops observed in the areas around the Mosque and South-East of the city. There are also ROADBLOCKS that cut off the entire road, keep these in mind and reference the markers on your maps."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{CB469B4305E8C146}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "III. Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "	The IED exploded near the SEARCH AREA. We can expect at least on group of Americans around there in the buildings held up after that explosion."\
     ""\
     "          -At least one possible injured group in the SEARCH AREA."\
     ""\
     "	  -Another 2 groups have been spotted SOMEWHERE ELSE in the South and West portions of the city."\
     ""\
     "	  -The IED hit an American BFV, we are sure they have more and will bring them in to stop us."\
     ""\
     "	  -Last known position of the BFVs was North of the city."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EC5AC2A8BE092773}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
     m_sContent "	Get out of they city. The BFVs are coming to pickup the wounded, get them out, and all the SEAL units out as well. Do what it takes to survive and make it to the extraction at the Northern OP."\
     ""\
     "          -Extract with 100% of surviving players to win."\
     ""\
     "          -At 90% casualties it will be considered a loss."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6C2D25AE2899BBEC}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
     m_sContent "	We must kill all of them. Don't let them leave the city and crush them with our numbers."\
     ""\
     "          -Victory only comes with killing 90% of the Americans"\
     ""\
     "	  -If more than 10% Extract- we lose. Don't let them leave the city."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{ABF744BF9AD5FD21}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Mission Notes (IMPORTANT)"
     m_sContent "	NOTE THAT THE BLUEFOR TEAM MUST REACH THE \"EXTRACTION\" MARKER ON THEIR MAPS TO EXTRACT AND FINISH MISSION. Not just leave the city."\
     ""\
     "	Both teams will have a 2:00 setup timer for setup/security."\
     " "\
     "BFVs AND CREWS:"\
     "	At least 1 BFV Crew must be slotted and BFVs must make their way to the marker on their maps before anything (barring CO orders in-mission or FROGMAN 6 ROMEO being wiped out). But the BFVs MUST GET INTO THE CITY and provide support to the SEALS."\
     ""\
     "NAVY SEALS:"\
     "	Mission intent is for SEALS to fill FROGMAN 6 ROMEO first. Be advised, during the setup timer you will be surrounded and taking fire, get to cover and get security right away during the duration of the setup timer."\
     ""\
     "INSURGENTS:"\
     "	The RPG Cache is optional but helpful against the BFVs and note that the SEARCH AREA does NOT indicate exact enemy locations. Riflemen in the MG Cell are intended to use the arsenal to grab backpacks and extra belts/mags for the MG and ARs."\
     ""\
     "	End Conditions:"\
     "	  Task Unit Bruiser:"\
     "	  - Extract with 100% of surviving players to win."\
     "	  - At 90% casualties it will be considered a loss."\
     "  "\
     "	  Insurgents:"\
     "	  - Victory only comes with killing 90% of the Americans"\
     "	  - If more than 10% Extract Insurgents lose. Don't let them leave the city."\
     ""\
     "*If you see the End Condition message pop up at the beginning of the match saying Task Unit Bruiser was eliminated- ignore it*"\
     ""
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A0EA4F0988CCF4ED}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Creator Notes"
     m_sContent "Thank you to the community's mission makers and modders who make the missions and resources for missions as well as giving me tips for mission making. Very special thanks to RedTheKnown for his help in teaching me how to make mission from the ground up with no prior knowledge myself, and with his help when I got stuck at times making this mission."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
